---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" sideBarActiveItemID="about">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-2xl mb-8 min-h-[200px]">
    <!-- Background Image -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image: url('/nae_heroBackground.png')"></div>
    
    <!-- Dark Overlay for Text Readability -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-black/70 via-black/50 to-black/30"></div>
    
    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="relative z-10 p-6 flex flex-col justify-center min-h-[200px]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <!-- Profile Image -->
        <div class="w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 flex-shrink-0">
          <img 
            src="/new_profile.png" 
            alt="Daniel Hibbert - NotAnExpert" 
            class="w-full h-full rounded-full object-cover shadow-xl ring-4 ring-white/20"
          >
        </div>
        
        <!-- Title and Info -->
        <div class="text-left">
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Hey, I'm Daniel</h1>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm text-white rounded-full text-sm font-medium border border-white/30">
            Button Masher-in-Chief
          </div>
          <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full mt-3"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Bio Content -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
    <!-- Main Story -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">My Story</h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <p>
            Welcome to my corner of the internet! I started NotAnExpert because I noticed something: 
            the tech world often makes you feel like you need to be an expert before you can share 
            anything valuable. But some of the best learning happens in the messy middle - when 
            you're figuring things out, making mistakes, and discovering solutions.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            My journey with Azure and cloud technologies began out of necessity and grew into a 
            passion. What started as "I need to solve this specific problem" turned into "Wait, 
            this is actually really cool!" And now, years later, I'm still finding new ways 
            to be surprised by what's possible.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            I believe in learning in public, sharing the journey (not just the destination), 
            and proving that you don't need to wait until you're an expert to contribute to 
            the conversation. Some of my best blog posts come from documenting problems I'm 
            actively solving - complete with the dead ends, the "aha!" moments, and everything in between.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">What You'll Find Here</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-base-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Azure Adventures</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Real-world Azure implementations, Logic Apps experiments, and cloud architecture explorations.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-base-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">AI Experiments</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Playing with AI services, building intelligent solutions, and exploring what's possible.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-base-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Practical Tutorials</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Step-by-step guides for solving real problems, complete with code and lessons learned.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-base-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Learning Insights</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Honest reflections on the learning process, failures that led to breakthroughs, and curiosity-driven discoveries.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

